    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Rooftop] is a third-person action game with horror feel in which you escape from </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >an abandoned building to the rooftop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy the excitement of exploring athletic courses and mazes,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >as well as the suspense of being chased by zombies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character, MEIKIRA, step on a portal on his way home and ends up lost in an\u00a0abandoned building in another world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyway, you should be able to escape by going to the portal on the rooftop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >that you saw when you were falling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various traps and gimmicks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Muscular zombies will attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's conquer everything and aim for the rooftop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And let's go home where everyone is waiting for us.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has no save function but there is a stage select function.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your life or countdown timer reaches 0, the game is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life automatically recovers over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies can't be defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies are blown away when they touch explosives, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >rarely becomes unable to move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse sensitivity adjustment available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action support Xbox controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Number of endings: 2\u00a0 \u00a0Determined at random.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play time: 1~2hours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREDIT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game font: Zoro Gothic free font</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game BGM: MOMIZizm MUSiC\u00a0 free BGM</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Music-Note.jp\u00a0 free BGM</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trailer BGM: K-style Music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
